i.github.com/repos/chaos-mesh/chaos-mesh/releases/assets/715719084","id":715719084,"node_id":"RA_kwDODEqSt84qqQGs","name":"ghcr.io-chaos-mesh-chaos-mesh-v2.8.8.sig","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/pgp-signature","state":"uploaded","size":96,"digest":"sha256:18013607fd6f54d3af876eeee2a1aaa9907316ece3d4a8f91d9f008426d8241b","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-11-06T03:09:10Z","updated_at":"2026-11-06T03:09:10Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/chaos-mesh/chaos-mesh/releases/download/v2.8.8/ghcr.io-chaos-mesh-chaos-mesh-v2.8.8.sig"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chaos-mesh/chaos-mesh/tarball/v2.8.8","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chaos-mesh/chaos-mesh/zipball/v2.8.8","body":"This patch release fixes PhysicalMachineChaos configuration, workflow deletion, controller selection, and TimeChaos on ARM64. It also fixes Dashboard HTTP task parsing, skips terminated pods by default, and includes build updates.\n\n### Breaking changes\n\n> [!WARNING]\n> - **Redis Sentinel `redisPath`.** The previous boolean type was incorrect. Chaosd expects a directory string for the `redis-server` executable. This release corrects the field type to a string. Remove existing boolean values or replace them with a directory string before upgrading. [#5204](https://github.com/chaos-mesh/chaos-mesh/pull/5204)\n> - **PhysicalMachineChaos disk-fill.** Chaos Mesh uses `fill-by-fallocate`, while Chaosd uses `fallocate`. This release correctly maps the Chaos Mesh field to the Chaosd field. Chaosd defaults to `fallocate`, but Chaos Mesh uses `fallocate` only when `fill-by-fallocate` is explicitly set to `true`. Setting it to `false` or omitting it now uses `dd`. The field names and default behavior may be unified in a future release. [#5205](https://github.com/chaos-mesh/chaos-mesh/pull/5205)\n\n### Changed\n\n- Use Go build metadata for binary version information and preserve release versions for builds from release tags [#5198](https://github.com/chaos-mesh/chaos-mesh/pull/5198)\n- Remove CGO dependency from chaos-daemon-helper (cdh) [#4801](https://github.com/chaos-mesh/chaos-mesh/pull/4801)\n\n### Fixed\n\n- Fix PhysicalMachineChaos disk-fill requests to honor `fill-by-fallocate`. Setting it to `true` uses `fallocate`. Setting it to `false` or omitting it now uses `dd` [#5205](https://github.com/chaos-mesh/chaos-mesh/pull/5205)\n- Fix PhysicalMachineChaos Redis Sentinel `redisPath` to accept executable directories. Remove existing boolean values before upgrading [#5204](https://github.com/chaos-mesh/chaos-mesh/pull/5204)\n- Fix missing Kafka authentication, fill configuration, and IO broker settings in PhysicalMachineChaos, and keep Kafka credentials out of controller logs [#5203](https://github.com/chaos-mesh/chaos-mesh/pull/5203)\n- Fix the Chaos Dashboard HTTP task parser panicking on a header without a colon and accepting a command without a URL [#5200](https://github.com/chaos-mesh/chaos-mesh/pull/5200)\n- Fix workflow deletion getting stuck when reconcilers recreate dependent resources while their owner is terminating [#5101](https://github.com/chaos-mesh/chaos-mesh/pull/5101)\n- Fix selective controller enablement through `controllerManager.enabledControllers` for chaos experiments [#4980](https://github.com/chaos-mesh/chaos-mesh/pull/4980)\n- Skip Succeeded and Failed pods when `podPhaseSelectors` is unset [#5150](https://github.com/chaos-mesh/chaos-mesh/pull/5150)\n- Honor reconciliation cancellation in PhysicalMachineChaos requests to chaosd. [#5095](https://github.com/chaos-mesh/chaos-mesh/pull/5095)\n- Fix TimeChaos crashes on ARM64 and preserve injection errors. [#5179](https://github.com/chaos-mesh/chaos-mesh/pull/5179)\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/chaos-mesh/chaos-mesh/compare/v2.8.7...v2.8.8\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chaos-mesh/chaos-mesh/releases/436037537/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0}}